    "detailed_description": "This is a Chiptune Rhythm game for Halloween aficionados everywhere!  Six spooky songs with two difficulty settings. The easy mode has you controlling a witch as she collects pumpkins to the beat. Hard mode will test your reflexes as you move the little witch's wand in rhythm.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Saint-Sa\u00ebns \u2013 Danse Macabre<br></li><li> Paul Dukas - The Sorcerer's Apprentice<br></li><li> Richard Wagner - Ride of the Valkyries<br></li><li> Mussorgsky \u2013 Night on Bald Mountain<br></li><li> Giuseppe Verdi - Dies Irae from his Requiem<br></li><li> Chopin \u2013 \u201cFuneral March\u201d from his Piano Sonata No. 2</li></ul><br>[How to Play]<br>You must hit the notes at the right time<br><br>[Main Menu]<br>Left click....................................Choose a game<br><br>[Normal Mode]<br>Up/Down Arrow......................Move up or down<br>Spacebar....................................Toggle Pause<br><br>[Hard Mode]<br>Left/Right Arrow...................Move left or right<br>Spacebar..................................Toggle Pause<br><br>[Pause Mode]<br>Spacebar..................................Toggle Pause<br>Left click..................................Choose to resume playing or go to Main Menu",
